# Line endings ------------------------------------------------------------
# The Python scripts in this repo are meant to be run on Windows as well as
# Linux/macOS, and Python's text mode writes CRLF on Windows. Without this
# file, re-running pipeline.py / jump_mvp.py / image_pipeline.py on Windows
# rewrites every line of the generated JSON/CSV and `git status` reports the
# whole file as modified even though nothing changed but the line endings.
#
# Normalise every text file to LF inside the repository, and check it out as
# LF everywhere, so a local re-run produces a genuinely empty diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never line-ending-converted, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary
*.parquet binary
